<< set $PrudenceFavor to 100>>

<< set $RuthFavor to 100>>

<< set $EstherFavor to 100>>


You look frantically around for Prudence...but she is nowhere in sight.
<<set $hysteria to 2>>


This is a test to see if favor works.
-> Decrease Prudence's favor by 10. 
    <<set $PrudenceFavor to $PrudenceFavor- 10>>
-> Decrease Esther's favor by 10.
    <<set $EstherFavor to $EstherFavor - 10>>
-> Decrease your favor by 10.
    <<set $RuthFavor to $RuthFavor - 10>>

